  "aboutVersion": "Clai 1.0.0",
  "aboutBody": "An open-source music player (GPL-3.0), built clean-room: no code or assets from other services. The catalogue and songs come from a third-party music service through an unofficial API — declared openly in the repo README; the provider architecture lets other sources be added without touching the player. You can also paste a public playlist link from another music app: its track list is read, then matched to the catalogue here — no account needed. Lyrics from LRCLIB; artwork enrichment from MusicBrainz/Cover Art Archive; optional scrobbling to ListenBrainz with your own token. All your personal data — library, history, downloads — lives only on your phone.",
